contract, agreement, engagement contract, master agreement
msa, master service agreement, master services agreement
nda, non disclosure agreement, confidentiality agreement
rfp, request for proposal, tender, bid document

# Project lifecycle
kickoff, kick off, kick-off, project start, opening meeting
milestone, checkpoint, phase gate, deliverable date
deliverable, artefact, output, project output
brief, project brief, client brief, engagement brief
workshop, working session, workshop session

# Roles + governance
stakeholder, decision maker, sponsor, executive sponsor
steering committee, steering group, steerco
principal, partner, engagement partner, lead partner

# Commercial
retainer, monthly retainer, ongoing engagement
utilization, utilisation, billable hours, billable time

