# People
# NOTE: `prospect` deliberately excluded here even though recruiters
# use it - the sales section has `lead, prospect, opportunity` where
# `prospect` means a deal not a person, and the shared token would
# merge both classes into one cross-domain false-positive machine.
candidate, applicant, contender
hiring manager, hiring lead
recruiter, talent partner, talent acquisition

# Systems + assessment
ats, applicant tracking system
reference check, references, backchannel

# Compensation + offer
comp, compensation, salary, package, base, base salary
comp package, compensation package, total comp, total compensation
offer letter, offer, formal offer, verbal offer
counter offer, counter-offer, counteroffer, counter
notice period, notice, gardening leave
signing bonus, sign on bonus, joining bonus

# Fees
placement fee, success fee, recruiter fee

