# ==============================================================================
# Cross-cutting: meetings, comms, people, money
# Every persona uses these; kept generic so the same synonym
# helps a consulting kickoff query AND a recruiting kickoff query.
# ==============================================================================

# Meetings + sessions
meeting, call, sync, catch up, catchup, chat
one on one, one-on-one, one to one
