text, message, sms, dm, chat message
phone call, phone, ring, phone conversation

# People + parties
# NOTE: kept intentionally narrow. Do NOT add `lead` or `prospect`
# here - both are shared tokens that would collapse this line into
# the sales `lead, prospect, opportunity` equivalence class, letting
# a query about "the team lead" match chunks about sales
# opportunities (and vice-versa).
client, customer, account, buyer
team, group, squad
manager, boss, team lead
colleague, coworker, teammate

# Commerce
price, cost, fee, rate, charge
pay, payment, invoice, bill
refund, reimbursement, rebate
budget, spend, spending

# Common phrasing
